          },
          {
            "summary": "I am 45 and a housewife. Will I be in a class with college students?",
            "p": "No. The 11 am batch is women only and most are between 30 and 55. If that time does not suit you, tell us and we will find a mixed batch where you will be comfortable."
          },
          {
            "summary": "How does the free demo class work?",
            "p": "Message or call with your name and the time you prefer. Come and sit through one full class of the level we think fits you. At the end you decide. There is no form to fill and nobody follows up more than once."
          },
          {
            "summary": "What if I miss classes?",
            "p": "Each lesson runs in two or three batches a week, so you can attend the same lesson in another batch that week. If you travel for a month, we pause your course and you join the next batch at the same point."
          },
          {
            "summary": "Do you give a certificate?",
            "p": "Yes, a centre certificate with the level and attendance after the course. We say plainly that it is our own certificate, not a university one. Employers care about how you speak in the interview, and that is what we work on."
          },
          {
            "summary": "Is there a batch for IELTS or for studying abroad?",
            "p": "Not at present. We do spoken English and interview preparation and we do them properly. If you need IELTS coaching we will tell you honestly and suggest you look elsewhere."
          }
        ]
      }
